{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手連詩雅（Shiga）婚後育有愛女「星星」，一家幸福美滿，平日工作忙碌的Shiga，只要有時間就會抽空陪愛女，日前她趁着假期，與家人帶同女兒星星到主題樂園暢玩，並在社交網分享多張靚相及影片，從相片中可見，Shiga抱住星星在主題樂園地標前</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T02:22:07.236021+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:18.848467+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:18:18.848467+00:00","content_hash":"76d14d5b2ee28fb9fa42860e966c6d9546d9713401b12575189d838655198c74","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}